The class uses a `ScheduledExecutorService` to schedule the batch requests to the external API at regular intervals, ensuring efficient use of resources and scalability. The system also provides thread-safe operations to prevent race conditions when multiple users access the resource management system concurrently.

To cover all edge cases, unit tests are implemented for the `ResourceManagementSystem` class, including network outages and partial data retrieval. The tests ensure that the system can handle various scenarios, such as batch requests with rate limits, network errors, and partial data updates.']

