The `Notification` class represents a notification message, with an ID and a message body. The `sendNotification()` method takes an ID and a message body as input and sends the notification to all listeners registered for that ID. The `handleNotification()` method handles the notification by sending it to all listeners, with retries and fallback strategies in case of failures.

The `addNotificationListener()` and `removeNotificationListener()` methods allow adding and removing listeners for notifications. The `sendToAllListeners()` method sends a notification message to all registered listeners.

