To ensure robust error handling and efficient resource utilization, the request pool should implement retry logic with exponential backoff and jitter. The library can also use a circuit breaker pattern to protect against persistent failures. We can also implement comprehensive logging and monitoring mechanisms to capture and analyze errors, providing detailed insights into request lifecycles and system performance.

