```
3. **Performance Optimization**:

To optimize performance under high concurrency and memory constraints, we will implement lazy loading of schema components, parallel processing where applicable, and conduct thorough memory profiling and garbage collection analysis to manage resources efficiently. We will also optimize the schema validation process to handle deeply nested structures without significant performance degradation.
```c
#include <iostream>
