The code also defines several functions for loading and caching schemas and OAuth2 tokens, as well as validating data against a given schema using the cached schema and OAuth2 token. These functions are used in the `SchemaValidator` class to implement the validation functionality.

Note that this is just an example implementation of a modular C library for loading, caching, and validating schemas from multiple external sources. In practice, you may need to modify or extend this code to fit your specific use case.']

