The `processTransaction` method processes a payment transaction, using the appropriate authentication and concurrency mechanisms. It uses caching and resource management strategies for high-load scenarios. It also implements fine-grained locking mechanisms where necessary and provides configuration options for lock acquisition timeouts. The `performPayment` method performs the actual payment using the acquired access token.

